c;0.0001</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.21 (0.16&#x02013;0.26) <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.0001</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.37</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1.63 (1.40&#x02013;1.90)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Bad</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">IHC</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.13 (1.03&#x02013;1.24) <italic>P</italic>=0.009</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.06 (0.01&#x02013;0.11) <italic>P</italic>=0.015</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.0001</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">No change</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Mut</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.21 (1.07&#x02013;1.37) <italic>P</italic>=0.003</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.11 (0.03&#x02013;0.18) <italic>P</italic>=0.002</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.004</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1.04 (0.91&#x02013;1.19)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote5"><label/><p>IHC=immunohistochemistry; RR=relative risk; Mut=analysis of mutations using sequencing; RR and rate difference are shown together with 95&#x00025; c.i. and the <italic>P</italic>-value for the observed effect; Het=the <italic>P</italic>-value for homogeneity/heterogeneity; T&#x00026;F RR=relative risk, and 95&#x00025; c.i., after adjustment for publication bias using the trim and fill method calculated using a random effects model.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote6"><label>a</label><p>The &#x02018;good' group involved studies in which patients with normal p53 had survival rates of over 65&#x00025;; the &#x02018;bad' group involved studies in which patients with normal p53 had survival rates less than 65&#x00025;.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>